section.subsection:
The database described in Subsection (1):

shall use automated data exchanges;
shall identify a delinquent taxpayer by identifying information;
may be accessed only by the commission or a depository institution;
shall be used to determine whether a delinquent taxpayer identified in the database has the same identifying information as that of an account holder at a depository institution; and
shall be updated by the commission on at least a quarterly basis.
